# Helvety Monorepo Security Rules

## Dependency updates

When asked to update dependencies to latest stable compatible versions, use the **dependency-update** project skill (`.cursor/skills/dependency-update/SKILL.md`) and `docs/dependency-inventory.md`. Include non-npm assets (models, vendored workers/WASM, PDF.js worker via react-pdf, React Bits vendor, external repos), not only `package.json`. For the PDF and OCR zones, never pin `pdfjs-dist` independently of `react-pdf` — run `consistency:pdfjs-worker` after bumps (it validates both zones).
